{"id":44328,"ord":147,"n_segments":156,"prev":44327,"next":44329,"doc":{"id":"52986","title":"52986_Lawrence Brown oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Lawrence Brown","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/52986/","url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=52986"},"chapter":"Joint session with Barney Bigard","title":"Stink bomb tricks and Freddie Jenkins in Texas","category":"person_portrait","summary":"Bigard and Brown recall pranks and talk about Freddie Jenkins, now a deputy sheriff in Fort Worth.","period":"1930s","year_from":1930,"year_to":1939,"words":170,"start":[214,2],"end":[215,8],"url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=52986#s44328","tags":{"places":[{"name":"Philadelphia","focus":0,"type":"city"},{"name":"North Philadelphia","focus":0,"type":"neighborhood","in":"Philadelphia"},{"name":"Texas","focus":0,"type":"state"},{"name":"Fort Worth","focus":0,"type":"city","in":"Texas"}],"venues":[{"name":"Pearl Theatre","focus":1,"city":"Philadelphia"}],"bands":[{"name":"Duke Ellington Orchestra","focus":0,"leader":"Duke Ellington"}]},"people":[{"name":"Worth","qid":null,"n":2},{"name":"Freddie Jenkins","qid":"Q258507","n":1},{"name":"Deputy Sheriff","qid":null,"n":1}],"story":{"theme":10,"theme_name":"Band pranks, jokes and gigs gone wrong","community":17,"community_name":"Pranks, practical jokes and band humor","core":true},"blocks":[{"p":214,"b":2,"s":"MR. BIGARD","x":"-- what's that theater in Philadelphia?"},{"p":214,"b":3,"s":"MR. BROWN","x":"The big theater, or the Pearl?"},{"p":214,"b":4,"s":"MR. BIGARD","x":"The Pearl -- that's --"},{"p":214,"b":5,"s":"MR. BROWN","x":"The Pearl up in North Philly?"},{"p":214,"b":6,"s":"MR. BIGARD","x":"Yeah. I was telling her about she all broke up a stink bomb while we was playing 'Mood Indigo'."},{"p":214,"b":7,"s":"MR. BROWN","x":"Ah, well."},{"p":214,"b":8,"s":"MR. BIGARD","x":"I was telling her all the tricks they used to play on each other."},{"p":214,"b":9,"s":"MR. BROWN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":214,"b":10,"s":"MR. BIGARD","x":"You know I talked -- I talked to Freddie Jenkins."},{"p":214,"b":11,"s":"MR. BROWN","x":"Yeah, you were saying --"},{"p":214,"b":12,"s":"MR. BIGARD","x":"He's in Texas."},{"p":214,"b":13,"s":"MR. BROWN","x":"Down in Texas -- Deputy Sheriff."},{"p":214,"b":14,"s":"MR. BIGARD","x":"Right, how about that?"},{"p":214,"b":15,"s":"MR. BROWN","x":"In Ft. Worth."},{"p":214,"b":16,"s":"MR. BIGARD","x":"Yeah, he's something else, he sounds good."},{"p":214,"b":17,"s":"MR. BROWN","x":"You see him?"},{"p":214,"b":18,"s":"MR. BIGARD","x":"I didn't see him, I just talked to him."},{"p":214,"b":19,"s":"MR. BROWN","x":"Talked to him, huh. That's nice."},{"p":214,"b":20,"s":"MR. BIGARD","x":"He's happy down there, he says."},{"p":215,"b":0,"s":"MR. BROWN","x":"Yeah, he had a tough time."},{"p":215,"b":1,"s":"MR. BIGARD","x":"He sure did."},{"p":215,"b":2,"s":"MR. BROWN","x":"Twice in the hospital."},{"p":215,"b":3,"s":"MR. BIGARD","x":"He's just fine now."},{"p":215,"b":4,"s":"MR. BROWN","x":"That's great. He's kind of up there in age, too."},{"p":215,"b":5,"s":"MR. BIGARD","x":"Yeah. And he's a big shot down there in Texas, now."},{"p":215,"b":6,"s":"MS. WILLARD","x":"Whereabouts in Texas, do you know?"},{"p":215,"b":7,"s":"MR. BROWN","x":"Ft. Worth."},{"p":215,"b":8,"s":"MR. BIGARD","x":"Ft. Worth. Yeah."}]}